From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sean Rhodes <sean@starlabs.systems>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 12:35:36 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] MdeModulePkg/UefiPayloadPkg: Harden capsule progress UI and
 update cleanup

[ouroBIOS: commit a447cf5d1615 of MrChromebox's edk2, without the files
that TianoCore's tree does not have (tools/edk2-import.py): 1 in
edk2/OuroBiosPkg]

Provide BmpSupportLib unconditionally so capsule/boot logo paths do not
depend on CAPSULE_SUPPORT or BOOTSPLASH_IMAGE being enabled.

Add a text-console fallback to DisplayUpdateProgressLibGraphics when GOP
is unavailable, so missing graphics cannot abort an FMP capsule update.

Harden CapsuleUpdateData* variable cleanup: enumerate all capsule vendor
variables, log failures, and retry cleanup before ProcessCapsules() so
stale scatter-gather requests do not force every subsequent boot into
firmware-update mode.

Signed-off-by: Sean Rhodes <sean@starlabs.systems>
---
