 .../DxeCapsuleLibFmp/DxeCapsuleProcessLib.c   |  10 ++
 .../DxeCapsuleLibFmp/DxeCapsuleReportLib.c    | 108 ++++++++++--
 3 files changed, 240 insertions(+), 35 deletions(-)

